osquery table schema
--------------------

The embedded files internal/synth/osquery_schema.json and
internal/synth/osquery_platforms.json are adapted
from "osquery_schema_versions/5.24.0.json", the osquery table schema
published by the osquery project at https://github.com/osquery/osquery-site
(src/data/osquery_schema_versions), Copyright (c) The osquery authors,
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

They have been modified: osquery_schema.json keeps only each table's name and
its columns' names, types and hidden flags, and osquery_platforms.json keeps
only each table's name and platforms. Descriptions, examples and all other
fields were removed. The underlying table specifications come from osquery
(https://github.com/osquery/osquery), licensed Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-only;
no osquery source code is included in phantomfleet.

